{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1372.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"73c12a9b9e6cdddf9eae2036b238d180a2e9925e1415c21e430669b84bc5ad78","ja":"スッキリしよう！","zh":"畅快地喊出来吧！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1372.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"80faccdbf1c797276967b22846d6a9fb0449c046738dc3ec1ecd0579ff1c5199","ja":"ちょっとだけだけど時間はあるし、\nリフレッシュできたら、また元気が出ると思うよ！","zh":"虽然时间不算充裕，\n但转换一下心情的话，我想应该又能打起精神来了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1372.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d393051b553cd7dd811bf68a08f2dcbf101fcbbc0110ce67923afb3066208fd4","ja":"そうね。私も一度頭をスッキリさせたかったし、\nいいんじゃないかしら。","zh":"也是呢。我也正想让头脑彻底清醒一下，\n这样挺好的不是吗。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1372.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"495393a4bc2dfada53700eb2764fdd8a3db600a930d7452f3b26a0f0261414b0","ja":"いいですね！\nでも、何をするんですか？","zh":"挺不错的呢！\n不过，要做些什么呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1372.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"88a85ecc8c5ebb7b90f2497f5586f753e3807c9635e38511d2bc12c39e753ce6","ja":"へへっ。\nそれはほら、さっきの取材で可奈が話してたやつで♪","zh":"嘿嘿。\n那不是可奈刚才在采访里说的那件事嘛♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1372.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"205fc62658fddcc307827bec49a173466785c7e6b521e92bee76060d2b03187b","ja":"私が……って、外で大きな声を出すことですか？","zh":"由我来……不对，是指在外面大声喊叫吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1372.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"ae8fac7b421920f8ccd273dd49b925870f01f216170c97784615d9da3dde4178","ja":"なるほど……見晴らしもいいし、\nここに来ただけでも気分転換になりそうですね。","zh":"原来如此……视野也很开阔，\n光是来到这里感觉就能换个心情呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1372.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"c8b50e9a66778e135b9d1dcbdcde16ac480ed0d7d0ee6e5070746e03ffdd1ce7","ja":"でしょ？　それに、大きな声を出しても、\nあんまり迷惑にならなさそうだし！","zh":"对吧？而且就算大声喊叫，\n好像也不会太打扰到别人！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1372.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"c29c4293d78948acc5f4ff6068e333549fcf9d530f529dfe2a429d2685e1c714","ja":"にひひっ、ちょっとワクワクするじゃない♪\nさあ、誰からいく？","zh":"嘻嘻，让人有点跃跃欲试了呢♪\n来吧，从谁先开始？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1372.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"59954c7f6236586ffbeb0eab7d2107b67c35f7086e57ead081126d70318ab971","ja":"ここで叫ぶんですか？　で、でも……。\nさすがにトップバッターは恥ずかしくて……。","zh":"要在这里喊吗？但、但是……。\n打头阵未免也太不好意思了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1372.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"524246f82f7e637eb96201ff84a10b6a7cb78b330b1f53edd0c71642d4019dfa","ja":"じゃあ、私から！\n矢吹可奈、1番手いきまーす♪","zh":"那我先来！\n矢吹可奈，第1棒上啦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
